<span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">첨부파일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">어학연수 모집 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">를 참고하시길 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -33.8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">3. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -33.8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">선발 전형 및 일정</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">서류전형</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<b>1) </b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">접수 일정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2025.05.07.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">오전 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">~ 2025.05.16.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">오후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">시까지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">기한 엄수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">접수 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ONEkit </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">통합정보시스템을 통해 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">자세한 사항은 첨부파일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">‘ONEkit </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">서류 접수 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">’</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">을 참고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">면접전형</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">면접 일정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">필요한 대상자만 진행하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">서류 합격자 중 개별 공지 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">면접 장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">국제교육관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">층 국제교류교육원 행정실 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">103</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">호</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">최종 선발 발표 및 합격자 오리엔테이션</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">최종 발표 일정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">28</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">Onekit</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">을 통해 선발 결과 발표</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6561\"></div><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">오리엔테이션 장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">국제교육관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">층 대형 강의실 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-seri