<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">유의사항</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">국제 왕복 항공 이용을 위해 반드시 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">본인의 여권 만료 기간</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">을 사전에 확인해야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">개인 사정으로 인해 참가 신청을 취소할 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">항공 취소 위약금 및 수업료 등 발생하는</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">모든 수수료는 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">학생 본인이 부담</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">하며 추후 어학연수 신청 시 지원이 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">제한</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">될 수 있음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 12pt;\">출석 미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 12pt;\">성적 미달 등으로 인해 수료하지 못한 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">대학 지원금 전액을 반납해야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">어학연수 홍보 영상 및 보고서</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">국제 홈페이지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">어학연수 보고서:&nbsp;</span><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://iplec.kumoh.ac.kr/iplec/sub080402.do\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><span style=\"color: rgb